According to the react docs shouldn't we be spreading at every level since spread is a shallow copy: https://react.dev/reference/react/useReducer#ive-dispatched-an-action-but-the-screen-doesnt-update

```js
return {
    ...state,
    plugins: {
      ...state.plugins,
      [action.pluginId]: {
        ...state.plugins[action.pluginId],
        isReady: true,
      },
    },
  };
```
